 anyone committed to responsible social action may apply.\"},{question:\"Do I need previous volunteering experience?\",answer:\"No. Previous experience is helpful but not required. Willingness to learn, collaborate, and contribute responsibly is more important.\"},{question:\"Is volunteering paid?\",answer:\"Volunteer roles are generally unpaid and focused on community service, learning, participation, and social impact. Any role-specific support will be communicated separately.\"},{question:\"Can I volunteer only during events?\",answer:\"Yes. You may choose regular, flexible, online, weekend, or event-based volunteering according to your availability.\"},{question:\"Will I receive a volunteer certificate?\",answer:\"Certificates or letters of appreciation may be issued based on participation, contribution, attendance, and the applicable programme guidelines.\"},{question:\"Can I volunteer remotely?\",answer:\"Some opportunities in research, technology, design, communication, content, and digital outreach may be available remotely.\"},{question:\"How will I know if my application is accepted?\",answer:\"The UDBHAV volunteer coordination team will review your application and contact you through the email address or mobile number provided.\"}];function c(){let[e,t]=(0,a.useState)(0);return(0,r.jsx)(\"section\",{\"aria-labelledby\":\"volunteer-faq-heading\",className:\"relative w-full py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-20 bg-pure-white\",children:(0,r.jsxs)(l.m,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(\"div\",{className:\"max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14\",children:(0,r.jsxs)(i.G,{as:\"div\",index:0,children:[(0,r.jsx)(\"span\",{className:\"eyebrow-label font-heading text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase block mb-2\",style:{color:\"#439B25\"},children:\"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS\"}),(0,r.jsx)(\"h2\",{id:\"volunteer-faq-heading\",className:\"font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-3\",style:{color:\"#12245F\"},children:\"Got Questions? We’